Package: BreedingR
Type: Package
Title: Genetic Parameters, Breeding Values and Genomic Prediction
Version: 0.4.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Felipe Andre Oliveira", "Freitas", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  email = "phyllype.freitas@gmail.com")
Description: Variance component estimation by AI-REML, breeding values, accuracy and
    single-step genomics (ssGBLUP), with reaction norms, direct-maternal and sire and
    maternal-grandsire models, several traits at once, metafounders, and a Gibbs sampler
    for Gaussian and binary traits. Single step also by the APY inverse or by markers as
    equations, with marker effects and quality control alongside. The numerics live in the
    package itself, in C++ with no external dependency, checked against independent
    paths: the dense V form, central finite differences, recovery of simulated
    components, and the published examples of Mrode and Pocrnic (2023). No package
    dependency at run time. Developed with support from the Sao Paulo Research
    Foundation (FAPESP), grants 2024/15502-6 and 2025/02949-5; the Coordenacao de
    Aperfeicoamento de Pessoal de Nivel Superior (CAPES), Finance Code 001; and the
    Conselho Nacional de Desenvolvimento Cientifico e Tecnologico (CNPq).
License: GPL-3
URL: https://github.com/phyllype/BreedingR, https://phyllype.github.io/BreedingR/
BugReports: https://github.com/phyllype/BreedingR/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
